AdapterContractApproval::approveContract(address)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── given caller is owner
│   ├── when contractAddress is zero address
│   │   └── it should revert with AdapterContractApprovalInvalidInput
│   ├── when contractAddress is already approved
│   │   └── it should revert with AdapterContractApprovalInvalidInput
│   └── when contractAddress is not approved
│       ├── it should set isApprovedContract[contractAddress] to true
│       └── it should emit AdapterContractApproved(contractAddress)
└── state invariants
    └── it should not modify unrelated storage

